libva-v4l2-stateful (0.1.0+git6447ebb-0diting4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * msm_drv_video.so is no longer installed. qcom-va-driver, which this
    package now depends on, takes the msm name as of 1.1.1+gitee8622c-0diting6,
    so the default VA-API driver decodes and encodes. What remains under
    v4l2_drv_video.so is for snap Chromium's own copy (diting-chromium-vaapi).

