libva-v4l2-stateful (0.1.0+git6447ebb-0diting3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * udev rule: symlink /dev/video-dec0 to the iris decoder. The driver opens
    only /dev/video0 or /dev/video-dec0, and the decoder is /dev/video0 only
    when it registers before the cameras (2026-11-27: it was /dev/video4).

